{:edb/committed true :edb/basis-t 1400 :edb/replayed false :edb/tx-hash "e024a622330613cff84c6a8a9300b1acfc423b9bab3a3b4cd12a05321212cd0f" :edb/db-before-t 1399 :edb/db-after-t 1400 :edb/tx-data [[13194139534712 50 #inst "2026-10-12T08:40:35.824Z" 13194139534712 17592186045417 true] [17592186119084 1078 #edb/ref 17592186119087 13194139534712 17592186045417 true] [17592186119749 1038 #edb/ref 17592186433629 13194139534712 17592186045417 true] [17592186119749 1038 #edb/ref 17592186433630 13194139534712 17592186045417 true] [17592186120495 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139534712 17592186045417 true] [17592186120495 1071 "Find the curvature at an arbitrary point on the curve $r(s)$ parametrized by its arc length $s$, where\n\n$$\nr(s)=⟨\\operatorname{cos}⁡s,\\,\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡s,\\,\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡s⟩,\\,0\\le s<2\\pi .\n$$" 13194139534712 17592186045417 true] [17592186120495 1071 "Find the curvature at an arbitrary point on the curve $r(s)$ parametrized by its arc length $s$, where\n$r(s) = ⟨\\cos s, \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\sin s, \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\sin s⟩, 0 \\le s < 2π$." 13194139534712 17592186045417 false] [17592186120495 1074 "Let $T(s)$ denote the unit tangent to the given curve as a function of the arc length $s.$ Since we are given the curve $r(s)$ parametrized by the arc length $s$, we will use the following formula for the curvature:\n\n$$\nκ(s)=‖{T}^{′}(s)‖=‖{r}^{″}(s)‖\n$$\n\nNow, we calculate ${r}^{′}(s)$ and ${r}^{″}(s)$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}^{′}(s) & =⟨\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}s}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡s),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}s}(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡s),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}s}(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡s)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-\\operatorname{sin}⁡s,\\,\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡s,\\,\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡s⟩ \\\\ {r}^{″}(s) & =⟨\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}s}(-\\operatorname{sin}⁡s),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}s}(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡s),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}s}(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡s)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-\\operatorname{cos}⁡s,\\,-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡s,\\,-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡s⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, the curvature is  \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}κ(s) & =‖{r}^{″}(s)‖ \\\\  & =\\sqrt{{(-\\operatorname{cos}⁡s)}^{2}+{(-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡s)}^{2}+{(-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡s)}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{{cos}^{2}⁡s+\\frac{1}{2}{sin}^{2}⁡s+\\frac{1}{2}{sin}^{2}⁡s} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{{cos}^{2}⁡s+{sin}^{2}⁡s} \\\\  & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534712 17592186045417 true] [17592186433616 1043 #edb/ref 17592186433631 13194139534712 17592186045417 true] [17592186433616 1043 #edb/ref 17592186433632 13194139534712 17592186045417 true] [17592186433616 1043 #edb/ref 17592186433633 13194139534712 17592186045417 true] [17592186433616 1044 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139534712 17592186045417 true] [17592186433616 1045 "Introduction to Curvature" 13194139534712 17592186045417 true] [17592186433616 1046 #edb/ref 17592186433631 13194139534712 17592186045417 true] [17592186433616 1048 #edb/ref 17592186046660 13194139534712 17592186045417 true] [17592186433616 1049 #edb/ref 17592186049196 13194139534712 17592186045417 true] [17592186433616 1053 #uuid "2b8eb350-78af-5600-9e7a-328caccbfa84" 13194139534712 17592186045417 true] [17592186433617 1080 "\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}" 13194139534712 17592186045417 true] [17592186433617 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139534712 17592186045417 true] [17592186433617 1083 #uuid "1251bed4-415d-5590-a871-e4a9657e13d3" 13194139534712 17592186045417 true] [17592186433618 1080 "\\sqrt{2}" 13194139534712 17592186045417 true] [17592186433618 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139534712 17592186045417 true] [17592186433618 1083 #uuid "1367431b-f708-53d0-907c-401baf44b1b0" 13194139534712 17592186045417 true] [17592186433619 1080 "\\sqrt{2}" 13194139534712 17592186045417 true] [1759